  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Chicken Dog Coop nears Emperor City, white lights rise across Central Continent like floating lanterns the size of dandelions. Fang Yuan finds none of his probes work, even though the killer move spans the whole continent. The lights then land on Central Continent Gu Immortals in Emperor City, Heavenly Court, Infallible blessed land, and elsewhere on the continent. This is human path killer move Hope of the People. It and the following move are Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s gains from exploring human path, while people’s united hearts and Broken Homes and Dead Family are Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable’s. Hope of the People together with Heroes Among People is treated as two rank nine killer moves used together.",
      "chapters": [
        1724
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
