        "move_broken_homes_and_dead_family",
        "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable",
        "move_heroes_among_people"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Western Desert strikes Emperor City, Shen Shang fails to resolve the venerable methods and instead triggers Hope of the People and Heroes Among People in advance; white light gathers on Central Continent Gu Immortals again.",
      "chapters": [
        1931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "premature-trigger",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "char_shen_shang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Di Chang names both as Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s human path killer moves and says they have no problem lasting through the entire battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "naming-and-duration",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_di_chang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Shen Shang pours the human will of the other four regions into Central Continent, Hope of the People and Heroes Among People distinguish allies by human will, so Gu Immortals of all five regions receive amplification.",
      "chapters": [
        1948
      ],
